From 3830a014eb157e28d783f530364798a4f8827ed8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 16:46:04 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Per-view visibility bound: --sem_min_contrib_px

A view counts as a valid observation of a Gaussian only if its contribution sum
(sum over pixels of alpha * T) divided by the footprint area pi * radius^2 is at
least the given value. Default 0 keeps the previous condition (contribution sum > 1e-6).
run_decisive.sh: MIN_CONTRIB_PX environment variable (default 0).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01PHmjveU9kNqt1TKBUX99W4
