 DECISIVE_EXPERIMENT.md     |  2 +-
 arguments/__init__.py      |  1 +
 run_decisive.sh            |  4 +++-
 tests/test_decisive_cpu.py |  5 ++++-
 train_sim.py               | 11 ++++++++++-
 5 files changed, 19 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

